# Build-a-Spec dependency INTENT (Python 3.11+). This file says what the app
# needs and which versions it accepts; requirements.txt is the exact lock that
# every install uses (CI, the Windows release build, a source checkout).
#
# After changing anything here, regenerate the lock from the repo root:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --universal --python-version 3.11 -o requirements.txt
# then review the diff and commit both files. A lock upgrade without an intent
# change is the same command with --upgrade (or --upgrade-package NAME).
# tests/test_requirements_lock.py checks that every name here is pinned there.

